[2025-08-26T19:41:45Z DEBUG mdbook_mermaid] e=Text(Borrowed(" thinking and the use of programming languages to express computations. By contrast, we have done much less well teaching reasoning and the formal languages and thought processes needed to reason formally in practice.")), span=3285..3502
